{"infoCategory": {"title": "Metal", "description": "<h1>A selection of <b>metals</b> used to create an <strong>industrial chic style</strong></h1>\r\n<p>We offer <strong>customisable designer furniture</strong> with a wide range of metallic finishes to adapt them to any need in terms of space and aesthetics. Metal has established itself in the <strong>modern designer furniture sector</strong> precisely because of its industrial style. The most appreciated features are durability, practicality and the bold and minimal look. Moreover, metal details combined with more traditional materials such as marble or natural wood fit coherently into a <strong>contemporary living room</strong>. Different variants and colours are therefore created to meet various needs: embossing with a grainy feel, smooth, uniform coatings, brushed surfaces with an engraved visual effect and many other artistic effects for disruptive items.\r\n<br><br>\r\nFor routine <strong>cleaning of metal</strong> surfaces use a soft, slightly damp cloth. Do not use abrasive detergents, solvents, ammonia or acetone. To remove stains, use a neutral soap and water solution and dry wet surfaces immediately.</p>", "elements": 19, "tipologie": {"Metal": {"idCategoriaProdotto": 65, "sNomeCategoria": "Metal", "sottoCategorie": []}, "Embossed": {"idCategoriaProdotto": 67, "sNomeCategoria": "Embossed", "sottoCategorie": []}, "Brushed": {"idCategoriaProdotto": 68, "sNomeCategoria": "Brushed", "sottoCategorie": []}, "Oxy": {"idCategoriaProdotto": 69, "sNomeCategoria": "Oxy", "sottoCategorie": []}, "Varnished": {"idCategoriaProdotto": 97, "sNomeCategoria": "Varnished", "sottoCategorie": []}}}, "productsList": {"67": [{"ColorID": "1827", "idCategory": "63", "News": 0, "sNomeColore": "GFM11 titanium embossed", "sNomeMateriale": "Embossed", "sNomeMaterialeStile": null, "sIdMateriale": 67, "sIdMaterialeStile": null, "tipologia": "63,67", "Novita": "", "sCodColoreAS400": "", "Thumbs": [{"imgProdotto": "https://download.cattel